# Verified runtime payloads and EFI helpers are versioned for fresh checkouts.
# Rebuild and privacy-check them before replacing the bundled copies.

# Development-agent configuration is local, not part of the product source.
/.agents/
# Ship the app-editing skill used by Edit the App; keep other local agent files private.
!/.agents/
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/edit-yougori/
!/.agents/skills/edit-yougori/SKILL.md
